  "releaseNotes": "Avoid per-call contract timeout timers for warmed snapshots, while bounding actual fetches, semaphore waits and refreshes by the original RPC deadline. Reuse cached MVC parameter metadata and skip unused resource-filter contexts. Preserve 3.0.x wire compatibility, authorization, MVC filters, hash validation and cancellation. See CHANGELOG.md and docs/client-performance.md.",
